@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
title Open session and Staff QR - code baseline 6d83eac
autonumber
actor SERVICE_STAFF as Staff
boundary DiningSessionController as C
control DiningSessionServiceImpl as S
participant SessionDiningSessionStaffAccessProvider as Access
database "JPA repositories / DB" as DB
Staff -> C : POST /api/v1/dining-sessions\nOpenDiningSessionRequest + login cookie
C -> S : openSession(request)
S -> Access : requireServiceStaffAccess()
Access --> S : SERVICE_STAFF / reject
group single transaction
 S -> DB : RestaurantTableRepository.findByIdForUpdate(tableId)
 DB --> S : table row locked
 S -> S : require AVAILABLE / total people >=1 / <=capacity
 S -> DB : read package and soup; require active
 S -> S : generate SecureRandom QR token\nconstruct session with packagePriceAtOpen
 S -> DB : table.occupy(); save(table)\nsaveAndFlush(session ACTIVE)
end
S --> C : DiningSessionResponse (Staff-only QR token; no price snapshot)
C --> Staff : 201 + Location
Staff -> Staff : QRCodeSVG points to /customer/qr#token=...\npoll/get Staff session to show rotated QR
note over C,DB
 Missing resource ->404; invalid DTO ->400;
 occupied/capacity/inactive business rule ->409.
 Row lock prevents two ACTIVE sessions for one table.
 packagePriceAtOpen stays internal; Billing reads it through its reader.
 startTime: LocalDateTime from UTC Clock; mapper emits UTC OffsetDateTime.
end note
@enduml
